{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：05:43 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：05:43 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：05:43 2026-11-11 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/356632cec57aed6a1178dd2d3b658e73/2026-11/north_hospital_0.jpg\"/><p>上水發生工業意外。今日（11日）凌晨近2時，一名姓楊（52歲）男子在上水安樂門街工作期間，在一輛中型貨車上高處墮下受傷。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，楊男清醒被送往北區醫院治理。經初步調查，相信楊男在貨車上搬貨期間，意外從約一米高墮下。案件列工業意外—有人意外受傷。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T22:07:56.025711+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:43:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T03:04:52.114247+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T22:01:27.433181+00:00","content_hash":"f07333073183bb43da464948dca34a52d86321390297c9b4c904c927dd919874","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}